OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 28 NOV
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Max Roach
OL,5,     GKate Molleson is joined by Kevin
OL,6,     GLeGendre to explore the life and
OL,7,     Gwork of drummer and composer Max
OL,8,     GRoach. Today exploring the
OL,9,     Gdizzying range of collaborations
OL,10,     Gin his final decades.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GThe Solem Quartet perform live in
OL,13,     Gthe studio for Sarah Walker and
OL,14,     GMel Giedroyc on her debut this
OL,15,     Gweekend in English National
OL,16,     GOpera's HMS Pinafore.
OL,17,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,18,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,19,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
